      "content": "what do you mean by \"phantom goblin\"? that makes no sense. i'm not looking for metaphors or stories, i'm looking for a technical explanation for why a technician can't see anything in a housing that is clearly making a loud noise. \n\ncan you please drop the weirdness and give me specific, professional advice on what mechanical parts could cause a rhythmic noise that isn't visible to a flashlight? what are the actual failure modes here?",
      "source": "evaluator"
